@gateway = http://localhost:5100
@catalog = http://localhost:5101
@orders = http://localhost:5102

### Gateway overview
GET {{gateway}}/

### Catalog readiness
GET {{catalog}}/health/ready

### List products through the gateway
GET {{gateway}}/catalog/api/products

### Create a product through the gateway
POST {{gateway}}/catalog/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "4K Monitor",
  "description": "27-inch monitor for development and design.",
  "price": 329.90,
  "stock": 12
}

### List orders through the gateway
GET {{gateway}}/orders/api/orders

### Create an order through the gateway
# Replace productId with an id returned by GET /catalog/api/products.
POST {{gateway}}/orders/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "customer@commerce.dev",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}
